{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any button on your keyboard or controller to make your bottle jump through obstacle-filled levels. Just don't use too much power, or your bottle will CRACK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reach the cauldron  without breaking yourself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/a60b9815446fbdf74b195613d511f702.poster.avif?t=1761341403\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/a60b9815446fbdf74b195613d511f702.webm?t=1761341403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/a60b9815446fbdf74b195613d511f702.mp4?t=1761341403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; Party Mode:</strong> Play alone and master the jumps for speedruns, or share the screen with friends for chaotic local matches. Each player only needs one button, so anyone can join in instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/8021211c444a9bbfdaecbf7a46b9825d.poster.avif?t=1761341403\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/8021211c444a9bbfdaecbf7a46b9825d.webm?t=1761341403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/extras/8021211c444a9bbfdaecbf7a46b9825d.mp4?t=1761341403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Join public or private rooms with up to 12 players and compete worldwide. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional mode: Move together while avoiding obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leader mode: The camera follows the player in front, and those who fall too far behind are destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race Mode (Online Mode): Race against others with the camera following your bottle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom options: Disable checkpoints, timers, or player collisions for unique challenge.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Unlock cosmetics for bottle trails and explosions, collect different bottle models by achieving in-game milestones, and earn emotes for the emote wheel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong>:\u00a0Every action can be performed with a single key or controller button, and all inputs can be rebound to fit your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the chaos, compete with friends, and see if you don't make your BOTTLE CRACKS!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982830?t=1761341403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/562dbc202552446ccda228c8c2a29299c27bd393/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761341403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/3d1bba66bc24e03a60aaaf0a0b24a6a4a225dfea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761341403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/3d1bba66bc24e03a60aaaf0a0b24a6a4a225dfea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761