d see if you don't make your BOTTLE CRACKS!</p>","developers":["Alunova Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982830/e2c02100d8d7b567b6845e4cef174585431a92b6/header.jpg?t=1761341403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3982830/1385579699/8b1c8bef0f6840c3376be5ec489bc2fa84a28ec6/1760914013/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760914577","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3982830/1385579699/8b1c8bef0f6840c3376be5ec489bc2fa84a28ec6/1760914013/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760914577","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3982830/1385579699/8b1c8bef0f6840c3376be5ec489bc2fa84a28ec6/1760914013/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760914577","id":257192868,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192868/movie480.mp4?t=1760914577","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192868/movie_max.mp4?t=1760914577"},"name":"Bottle Cracks \u2013 Public Playtest Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192868/3d96b2f52d4745a9c19b67d65489f8d6b0174183/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760914577","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192868/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1760914577","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192868/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1760914577"}}],"name":"Bottle Cracks","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></